## HistoryEdit

Siron began courting Lilith, but she rebuffed his advances. In retaliation, Siron kidnapped her and raped her to the point of conception. This enraged Adam, who cursed Siron to be eternally thirsty and barren of offspring. As a result, Siron could take no sustenance but blood, and his semen was infertile. The curse was passed down to all vampires thereafter.^{[1]}

